ellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[83,1215][997,1288]" /><node text="KWGT iOS_Battery_Widget converted to a separate native provider: a #B75B5B5B rounded card with 69 corners, a 92 level ring with a 10 #343434 track and 32 top/left padding, and the real percentage at 92 with 32 left / 16 bottom padding. ProductSans is replaced by platform sans-serif. The ring is green #3ABD54 at 25 percent and above, orange #FA9F1B below 25, and red #ED1B24 below 15; the centred icon is the source standard, low-battery alert or charging glyph from the real charging state. The stale media/cover gradient formula is inactive and not rendered. The percentage is a bounded best-effort snapshot refreshed by the existing inexact ~15 min battery window and manual Refresh, not a live push. No media, notification, service or Alarms &amp; reminders access is used.&#10;&#10;Previews use the selected style and current permission mode." content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[83,1288][997,1929]" /><node text="Add widget" content-desc="Add KWGT iOS Battery" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="true" bounds="[83,1971][997,2107]" /><node text="" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[83,2128][997,2254]"><node text="Prev" content-desc="Previous widget" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="true" bounds="[83,2128][251,2254]" /><node text="" content-desc="4 of 4" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[251,2128][829,2254]"><node text="" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[477,2180][498,2201]" /><node text="" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[512,2180][533,2201]" /><node text="" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[5